{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-15681","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-14558","text":"[&] Protocol — Agent Skills"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-15683","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-14559","marks":["bold"],"text":"Purpose:"},{"id":"spn-14560","text":" Teach any LLM or developer how to use the [&] Protocol correctly, idiomatically, and in the right sequence. These files cover everything from writing your first agent declaration to building providers that satisfy capability contracts."}]}],"id":"blk-15682","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-15684","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-14561","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-15685","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-14562","text":"Quick Orientation"}]},{"id":"blk-15686","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-14563","text":"The [&] Protocol is a "},{"id":"spn-14564","marks":["bold"],"text":"language-agnostic specification for capability composition in AI agents"},{"id":"spn-14565","text":". It defines how agents declare cognitive capabilities ("},{"id":"spn-14566","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"},{"id":"spn-14567","text":", "},{"id":"spn-14568","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason"},{"id":"spn-14569","text":", "},{"id":"spn-14570","marks":["code"],"text":"&time"},{"id":"spn-14571","text":", "},{"id":"spn-14572","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-14573","text":"), how those compose via "},{"id":"spn-14574","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-14575","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-14576","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-14577","text":" operators, and how declarations compile into MCP and A2A configurations."}]},{"id":"blk-15687","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-14578","text":"[&] sits at the "},{"id":"spn-14579","marks":["bold"],"text":"composition layer"},{"id":"spn-14580","text":" of the agent protocol stack — above MCP (agent-to-tool) and A2A (agent-to-agent). It does not replace either protocol. It generates configurations for both."}]},{"id":"blk-15688","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-14581","text":"The Core Workflow"}]},{"id":"blk-15689","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-14582","text":"Every interaction with [&] follows this rhythm:"}]},{"id":"blk-15690","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"1. DECLARE   → Write an ampersand.json agent declaration\n2. VALIDATE  → Check it against the JSON Schema (draft 2020-12)\n3. COMPOSE   → Verify capability compatibility and ACI properties\n4. GENERATE  → Compile to MCP config and/or A2A agent card"},{"id":"blk-15691","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-14583","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-15692","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-14584","text":"Skill Files"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-15694","spans":[{"id":"spn-14585","text":"File"}]},{"id":"blk-15695","spans":[{"id":"spn-14586","text":"What It Teaches"}]}],"id":"blk-15693","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-15696","spans":[{"id":"spn-14587","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/AmpersandBoxDesign/docs/skills/01_DECLARATION.md"}],"text":"01_DECLARATION.md"}]},{"id":"blk-15697","spans":[{"id":"spn-14588","text":"Writing ampersand.json declarations — structure, capabilities, providers, config"}]}],[{"id":"blk-15698","spans":[{"id":"spn-14589","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/AmpersandBoxDesign/docs/skills/02_VALIDATION.md"}],"text":"02_VALIDATION.md"}]},{"id":"blk-15699","spans":[{"id":"spn-14590","text":"Schema validation via CLI and SDKs — running checks, reading errors, batch mode"}]}],[{"id":"blk-15700","spans":[{"id":"spn-14591","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/AmpersandBoxDesign/docs/skills/03_COMPOSITION.md"}],"text":"03_COMPOSITION.md"}]},{"id":"blk-15701","spans":[{"id":"spn-14592","text":"Capability composition — "},{"id":"spn-14593","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-14594","text":" operator, `\\"}]},{"id":"blk-15702","spans":[{"id":"spn-14595","text":">` pipelines, ACI properties, type safety"}]}],[{"id":"blk-15703","spans":[{"id":"spn